        "species": 39,
        "text": "Jumping spiders have eight simple eyes, and you very likely have eight as well. In the bold jumping spider, the two big front eyes can follow a moving target only with guidance from the smaller eyes at the side. Nobody has measured what each of your eyes does unless you are a bold jumping spider.",
