            "grade": "m",
            "source": "Jakob 2018"
          }
        ],
        "note": "Left out the telephoto optics (R4, Plexippus validus only) and the vestigial rear eyes (R5, Lyssomanes only) to keep the row short.",
        "attempt": 1
