        "species": 39,
        "text": "If you are a regal jumping spider, your big front eyes have three kinds of color-sensing cell, and one kind senses ultraviolet. If you are a Plexippus validus, you have only two kinds, green and ultraviolet, and if you are a Habronattus pyrrithrix, you have three, with the red-sensing kind in a small patch at the center of the eye. Nobody has measured how many kinds you have if you are any other jumping spider.",
